      "v": 1,
      "zh": "「人若娶妻以后，见她有甚么不合理的事，不喜悦她，就可以写休书交在她手中，打发她离开夫家。",
      "en": "If a man marries a woman and she does not please him because he has found something indecent[NOTE:1] in her, then he may draw up a divorce document, give it to her, and evict her from his house.",
