      "v": 4,
      "zh": "打发她去的前夫不可在妇人玷污之后再娶她为妻，因为这是耶和华所憎恶的；不可使耶和华―你　神所赐为业之地被玷污了。」",
      "en": "her first husband who divorced her is not permitted to remarry[NOTE:1] her after she has become ritually impure, for that is offensive to the Lord.[NOTE:2] You must not bring guilt on the land[NOTE:3] that the Lord your God is giving you as an inheritance.",
      "notes": [
        "Heb “to return to take her to be his wife.”",
